      "threshold": "recovered < 1 with >= 50 stt_selection|stt_live_session attempts in 6h, per to_mode, for 30m",
      "user_impact": "That provider is not serving live sessions. The chain may still recover via another leg; if every remaining leg is also dead, sessions exhaust (see chain-exhaustion alerts). Deepgram has been in this state since 2026-09-14. Soniox was in this state for 27.5h on 2026-09-19/20 because recovered was recorded at connect.",
      "scope": "backend-listen omi_fallback_total component=~stt_selection|stt_live_session, grouped by to_mode. job=backend-listen-metrics Counter.",
      "verification": "Evidence layer is Cloud Logging. Deepgram: recovered=0 in both the 2026-09-18 09:00Z 5m tolerable window and the 2026-09-19 04:40-10:40Z 6h incident window; exhausted-to-deepgram was 20000+ (query cap) in that 6h. Soniox mid-session: omi_fallback_event was recorded as component=other from=modulate to=soniox outcome=recovered at connect (58 recovered alongside 42 budget closes in the 2026-09-19 16:00Z 2m window). After truthful recovery those hops are exhausted, recovered=0, so this rule would fire on to_mode=soniox. 2m budget-close/connect samples: 2026-09-19 03:00Z 30/30, 04:40Z 32/32, 2026-09-20 04:00Z 40/39 versus good 2026-09-18 09:00Z 0/16 and 2026-09-20 07:30Z 0/13. Prometheus evaluation of this exact increase() expression is still owed.",
      "safe_next_action": "Identify the to_mode on panel 16. For budget exhaustion see panel 18 and raise the vendor cap. For Deepgram, confirm the account/handshake error in backend-listen logs; do not rotate unrelated provider keys.",
      "runbook": "backend/docs/runbooks/resilience-dashboards.md",
      "evaluated_bad": "to_mode=soniox: Cloud Logging proxy of the lying recovered series was 58 in 2m at 2026-09-19 16:00Z with 42 budget closes the same 2m — after the fix recovered=0 and attempts>=50 over 6h. to_mode=deepgram recovered=0, exhausted>=20000 in 2026-09-19 04:40-10:40Z. Prometheus evaluation still owed.",
      "evaluated_good": "to_mode=soniox: 2026-09-18 09:00Z and 2026-09-20 after 07:30Z had 0 budget closes (0/16 and 0/13 connections); hops that transcribe would recover. to_mode=deepgram recovered=0 also in the 2026-09-18 09:00Z tolerable window — that leg has been dead through both periods, which is why the alert is the standing-failure detector. Prometheus evaluation still owed."
    },
